 five years, short of the 5% durability bar.","Forward indicators: deferred revenue up 23%.","Capex roughly matches depreciation (1.2x, 4.2% of sales), a maintenance pace.","Its Rule of 40 score is 6, below the 40 that marks a healthy growth business."],"own":["Insiders hold little stock (0.0%), and institutions hold 74%.","It returns 6.9% a year to shareholders (0.9% in buybacks and 6.2% in dividends).","It pays out 126% of earnings, more than it earns, so the dividend is at risk."],"people":["With about 460,000 employees, each generates about $193K of revenue, 0.5x the Industrials median, and revenue has grown 4.3% a year across its filed history.","That works out to $10K of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $4.0M (21x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores poorly (8/10, lower is better)."]},"profile":{"v":"INVEST","conv":77,"head":"Invest: trades 19% below fair value of $131; ROIC 21.9% vs WACC 8.4%.","pros":["Composite 46, above the 39 line (gates 13/25)","Trades 19% below fair value of $131","ROIC 21.9% vs WACC 8.4%","EV/EBITDA 9.6x vs sector 12.9x","12-1 month momentum +14%"],"cons":[],"flags":[],"need":[],"buy_below":111.44,"vc":{"base":131.1,"base_src":"dcf","bear":97.94,"bull":178.16,"alt_median":114.2,"n_alt":3,"gap":0.148,"dispersion":0.2681,"level":"MEDIUM","why":[]},"med":{"pe":22.1377,"ev_ebitda":12.904,"pfcf":21.8001,"pb":2.7623,"roic":0.0997,"gross_margin":0.2864,"fcf_margin":0.0677,"div_yield":0.0151}},"mc_quantiles":[78.41,89.68,97.94,104.0,108.5,112.65,117.07,120.48,124.74,128.57,132.4,135.91,139.5,144.24,149.82,155.57,161.88,169.12,178.16,198.8,224.46],"mc_drivers":{"growth":0.436,"discount_rate":0.468,"terminal_growth":0.027,"exit_multiple":0.07},"ticker":"UPS","date":"2026-11-20"}